    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d368-a1">

                <pb facs="0541" n="467" sameAs="frus:frus1866p2/pg467"/>


                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head>Mr. Bustamente to Mr. Seward.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Quito,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1866-04-25"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >April</hi> 25, 1866</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>I have the honor to transmit to you a certified copy of the despatch of this
                    day’s date, which the honorable secretary of the treasury has sent to me,
                    relative to the claim for the payment of the first instalment stipulated by the
                    mixed commission.</p>
                <p>I avail myself of this occasion to reiterate to you the assurances, &amp;c.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>MANUEL BUSTAMENTE.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
